<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:50:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</link><description>尽管人们对人工智能繁荣和相关工业金属需求的持久性仍存疑虑，但铜价从 11 个月低点上涨逾 3%，追随科技股的涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals'&gt;由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Rebounds as Tech Rally Lifts Battered Industrial Metals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:01:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>加纳回购11亿美元国内债券以提振信心</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence</link><description>加纳提前三个月赎回了四年期国内债券，政府试图增强投资者对经济从债务重组中复苏的信心。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence'&gt;加纳回购11亿美元国内债券以提振信心&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Ghana Buys Back $1.1 Billion Domestic Bonds to Boost Confidence&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:31:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>福特首席执行官谈勒芒、新型电动皮卡和贸易谈判</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/ford-ceo-on-le-mans-new-electric-pickup-and-trade-talks-video</link><description>彭博社的马特·米勒 (Matt Miller) 与福特首席执行官吉姆·法利 (Jim Farley) 坐下来讨论赛车、福特计划推出的 30,000 美元电动皮卡、中国电动汽车竞争和 USMCA 贸易谈判，重点讨论如何在全球舞台上竞争的同时保护美国汽车制造业。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/ford-ceo-on-le-mans-new-electric-pickup-and-trade-talks-video'&gt;福特首席执行官谈勒芒、新型电动皮卡和贸易谈判&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Ford CEO on Le Mans, New Electric Pickup and Trade Talks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/ford-ceo-on-le-mans-new-electric-pickup-and-trade-talks-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:00:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于市场恶化，凯斯基础设施部门暂停债券发行</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/la-caisse-s-infrastructure-arm-pauses-bond-sale-as-market-sours</link><description>金融市场状况的恶化正在阻止一家新的加拿大发行人按计划出售债券，即使有该国最重要的养老金管理公司之一的支持。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/la-caisse-s-infrastructure-arm-pauses-bond-sale-as-market-sours'&gt;由于市场恶化，凯斯基础设施部门暂停债券发行&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Caisse’s Infrastructure Arm Pauses Bond Sale as Market Sours&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/la-caisse-s-infrastructure-arm-pauses-bond-sale-as-market-sours</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:34:38 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>